## Testing & Quality Discipline

### 1. Compliance & Invariant Testing
Always validate environments against Gymnasium compliance tests:
```python
from gymnasium.utils.env_checker import check_env


def test_gym_compliance(env: CustomEnv) -> None:
    """Verify compliance with official Farama Gymnasium standards."""
    check_env(env.unwrapped)
```

### 2. Verification Commands
Always verify changes locally using `just`:
```bash
# Install agent skills
just setup-skills

# Run environment test suite
just test

# Check formatting and linting
just lint

# Format code automatically
just format

# Full validation (lint + test)
just check

# Run Farama Gymnasium conformance check via CLI
just test-env

# Baseline policy evaluation
just eval

# Interactive human play (Raylib window)
just play
```
